  Available Options (start with a  $  or  /  or  [ character):

  A - all user areas               N - no page pause [more]
  C - file sizes in records        Q - show non-$ARCHived files
  D - all drives                   T - order files by EXT type
  H - Current area to highest      V - show version number
  L - list LBR/ARC/ARK members     X - aux. format (horiz/vert)

  Example - to list all drives and user areas, no pauses:

                     B0>SD $AND <ret>

␀  * * * Special SYSOP Options (WHEEL SET) * * *
  F - file output (DISK.DIR)       R - reset disk system
  O - show $SYS files only         S - include $SYS files
  P - printer output
  1 - Check attrib 1               2 - Check attrib 2
  3 - Check attrib 3               4 - Check attrib 4
