   ZFCNFN.Z80 is an overlay which can  be used  to set the configuration bytes
in  ZFILER.COM.   The file  should  be  edited,  assembled to  a HEX file  and 
overlayed using the command:

             MLOAD ZFNEW=ZFILER.COM,ZFCNFNГрZ3ENV␀ю␀ZF11␀я␀я
