<img src=RSAS.JPG>

Walked about 1/3 of the run. Running tonight in the New Milford 5k. Friday
evening (7:45 P) race. 

MCT - Friday, June 2, 2017 at 20:32:14 (GMT) (subtract 4 for local time)

Did 8 miles this morning at a 11:54 pace. Yesterday found a state park near
my hotel in Middleboro MA. Lots of nice trails so I did 8 miles there. Sunday
I'm doing the Goodwin Forest 10k.

<a href=https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activity/1773336806>https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activity/1773336806</a>

