Got a thumbs up from a gal on the way out and an offer of water when I was
finishing up. Also spotted these in what I call the Apple Loop (a U-shaped
section off the main road. All the streets are named with apple names).

<img title="Apple Loop" src=http://primepuzzle.com/tpf/IMG_20160907_101844_433_scaled.jpg>

This was an 8+ mile run at a 14+ pace. First longish run since last Saturday.

<img title=Applause src=http://primepuzzle.com/tunxis/emo49.gif>

I ran 1+ miles on Monday and Tuesday but did not log them (too pathetic to
even mention). 

Thinking about doing the 10/20/30k Fall Distance Festival (Marty and Jim)
on September 18. Here's Gerweck's email. I promise I won't use the extremely
effective way to beat Joe Laskey I employed last year (cut out about 80%
of loop 2 and then claimed I made up the distance by doing an out and back
after completing loop 3).

<img src=http://primepuzzle.com/tpf/race23686-logo.bxFqdd.png>          

Thanks for joining us in the past for our scenic 10k loop thru Lordship,
in Stratford.

We guaranteed you'd have a water view every mile, in some areas be within
30 ft or so- And we didn't disappoint! We'd love to see you again Sept 18
on our nearly hill-less course. Whether you were in the 10/20/ or 30k we
hope you hit your goal. We will have three water stops with great kids that
volunteer and will  appreciate your smiles. There will be snacks and fluids
when you're done back at the beach. This year we have gift certificates to
the M&F winners of each event thanks to the Beach House Restaurant.

We are excited to be hooked up with a terrific restaurant that's just 1/10
mi from the start/finish. In fact you'll pass it on the way in. The Beach
House will give everyone with our race bib -25% off your bill on race day
or for up to a week after! You can use it just once - they're open for breakfast,
lunch, dinner and cocktails that surely will help you rehydrate after your
run. Make plans to stop in!

Please tell your friends we've got room for more runners. Race day reg is
available. See you soon!

