Module is already loaded.$
Non-permanent module active!$

SPEEDUP V1.2    Disk Cache Buffer RSX      by H.F.Bower

  Syntax:
	SPEEDUP [d:][s]
  Options:
	d: - Drive letter followed by colon
	s  - Size of cache in K (1-8)
  Defaults:
	Drive is currently logged
	Size is 4K (128 entries)
  Examples:
	SPEEDUP      - Cache 4K of current drive
	SPEEDUP 6    - Cache 6K of current drive
	SPEEDUP D:   - Cache 4K of drive D:
	SPEEDUP C:8  - Cache 8K of drive C:
