Syntax:	TCSRC [[dir:]infile[.Z3T]] [[dir:]outfile[.z80]]

	Default outfile name is infile.Z80.
	Infile 'BLANK' creates blank commented source code.
	If no infile is specified, Z3TCAP.Z80 is created 
		from the environment.
